# 8. What I think it should become

Both domains should follow exactly the same rule:

```text
                    Provider
              corporate/legal entity
                       │
                       │ has many
                       ▼
                    Offering
              public product/service
                       │
              ┌────────┼─────────┐
              │        │         │
              ▼        ▼         ▼
            profile  compare    tools
              │        │         │
              └────────┼─────────┘
                       │
                       ▼
                 Offering.slug
```

So:

### Shares

```text
/share-trading/commsec
/share-trading/stake
/share-trading/cmc-invest
```

### Crypto

```text
/crypto/exchanges/coinspot
/crypto/exchanges/kraken
/crypto/exchanges/btc-markets
/crypto/exchanges/independent-reserve
/crypto/exchanges/etoro-crypto
```

And comparisons:

```text
/share-trading/commsec-vs-stake

/crypto/exchanges/compare/coinspot-vs-kraken
```

Everything uses Offering identity.

